#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:2
msgid "Deployment Solution Programs"
msgstr "배포 솔루션 프로그램"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:4
msgid ""
"Mattermost's **Deployment Solutions Programs** help IT administrators "
"understand how Mattermost is being offered in third-party deployment "
"solutions, including other open source projects as well as in commercial "
"solutions."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost의 **배포 솔루션 프로그램(Deployment Solutions Programs)**\\ 은 IT "
"관리자가 다른 오픈소스 프로젝트와 상용 솔루션을 포함한 제3자 배포 솔루션에서 "
"Mattermost가 어떻게 제공되는지 이해하도록 돕습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:6
msgid ""
"This is an optional program for third-party developers to increase "
"awareness about their work and to enable Mattermost to refer its "
"communities to different solutions."
msgstr ""
"이는 제3자 개발자가 자신의 작업에 대한 인지도를 높이고 Mattermost가 "
"커뮤니티에 다양한 솔루션을 안내할 수 있도록 하는 선택적 프로그램입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:8
msgid ""
"Individuals or companies interested in exploring deployment solutions "
"with Mattermost are encouraged to reach out to us via the `Mattermost "
"Partner Program Form <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=24278352368532>`_."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost와 함께 배포 솔루션을 모색하고자 하는 개인이나 회사는 `Mattermost "
"파트너 프로그램 양식 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=24278352368532>`_\\ 을 통해 연락해 주세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:10
msgid "Deployment solutions are recognized by Mattermost at three-levels:"
msgstr "배포 솔루션은 Mattermost에서 세 가지 수준으로 인정됩니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Community Deployment Solutions** - Basic orchestration solutions for "
"Mattermost, typically from the open source community or hosting companies"
" who let us know about their work. The work of partners is included in "
"blog posts and on social media as a benefit to the user and customer "
"communities."
msgstr ""
"**커뮤니티 배포 솔루션** - Mattermost를 위한 기본 오케스트레이션 솔루션으로, "
"보통 자신의 작업을 알려 준 오픈소스 커뮤니티나 호스팅 회사에서 제공합니다. "
"파트너의 작업은 사용자 및 고객 커뮤니티에 도움이 되도록 블로그 게시물과 소셜 "
"미디어에 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:14
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "예:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Puppet deployment solution for Mattermost "
"<https://forge.puppet.com/liger1978/mattermost>`__ by Richard Grainger"
msgstr ""
"Richard Grainger의 `Mattermost용 Puppet 배포 솔루션 "
"<https://forge.puppet.com/liger1978/mattermost>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Heroku deployment solution for Mattermost <https://chrisdecairos.ca"
"/deploying-mattermost-to-heroku/>`__ by Christopher De Cairos"
msgstr ""
"Christopher De Cairos의 `Mattermost용 Heroku 배포 솔루션 "
"<https://chrisdecairos.ca/deploying-mattermost-to-heroku/>`__"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Registered Deployment Solutions** - Orchestration solutions that follow"
" detailed Mattermost guidelines on keeping up-to-date with the latest "
"Mattermost version and security updates (typically a one-line change), "
"linking to official documentation, supporting branding guidelines, and "
"maintaining a changelog. This level of engagement allows Mattermost to "
"more prominently promote the work, knowing that it's committed to meeting"
" explicit standards."
msgstr ""
"**등록 배포 솔루션** - 최신 Mattermost 버전 및 보안 업데이트 유지(보통 한 줄 "
"변경), 공식 문서 링크, 브랜딩 가이드라인 준수, 체인지로그 유지에 대한 "
"Mattermost의 상세 가이드라인을 따르는 오케스트레이션 솔루션입니다. 이 수준의 "
"참여를 통해 Mattermost는 해당 작업이 명시적 표준 충족에 전념하고 있음을 알고 "
"더 두드러지게 홍보할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Certified Deployment Solutions** - These solutions meet all the "
"requirements of Registered Deployment Solutions, with the addition that "
"they'll automate the version upgrade and security update processes "
"(typically a one-line change). There is the added benefit that when "
"Mattermost announces new versions and security updates, we can also "
"announce the availability of updates to Certified Deployment Solutions."
msgstr ""
"**인증 배포 솔루션** - 등록 배포 솔루션의 모든 요건을 충족하며, 추가로 버전 "
"업그레이드와 보안 업데이트 프로세스를 자동화합니다(보통 한 줄 변경). "
"Mattermost가 새 버전과 보안 업데이트를 발표할 때 인증 배포 솔루션의 업데이트 "
"제공도 함께 알릴 수 있다는 추가 이점이 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:23
msgid "To summarize the commitment level of different solutions:"
msgstr "다양한 솔루션의 참여 수준을 요약하면 다음과 같습니다:"

