#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:45
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Installation is designed for officially supported operating systems and"
" platforms**. EXCEPTION: RHEL equivalents (CentOS, Amazon Linux, Oracle "
"Linux, Scientific Linux) are acceptable as long as the exception is noted"
" in README or equivalent with ``This deployment uses [OPERATING_SYSTEM] "
"as an equivalent to the officially supported version of Red Hat "
"Enterprise Linux.``"
msgstr ""
"**설치는 공식 지원 운영 체제와 플랫폼을 대상으로 설계됩니다**. 예외: RHEL "
"동등 제품(CentOS, Amazon Linux, Oracle Linux, Scientific Linux)은 README "
"등에 ``This deployment uses [OPERATING_SYSTEM] as an equivalent to the "
"officially supported version of Red Hat Enterprise Linux.`` 와 같이 예외가 "
"명시되어 있으면 허용됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Automated installation passes basic testing**. After installation run "
"the following manual tests:"
msgstr ""
"**자동 설치가 기본 테스트를 통과합니다**. 설치 후 다음 수동 테스트를 "
"실행하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:51
msgid ""
"Create a new user account and use that account to create a new team and "
"post to Town Square channel."
msgstr ""
"새 사용자 계정을 만들고 그 계정으로 새 팀을 생성한 뒤 Town Square 채널에 글을 "
"올립니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:52
msgid ""
"Create a second user account and join the newly created team and reply to"
" first user's post in Town Square."
msgstr ""
"두 번째 사용자 계정을 만들어 새로 생성한 팀에 참여하고 Town Square에서 첫 "
"사용자의 글에 답글을 답니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:53
msgid "Go back to first user account and post reply with an image attached."
msgstr "첫 사용자 계정으로 돌아가 이미지를 첨부한 답글을 올립니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:54
msgid ""
"Confirm there are no errors and no red alert bar at the top of the screen"
" with \"Mattermost unreachable error\" (which would indicate a websocket "
"configuration error)."
msgstr ""
"오류가 없고 화면 상단에 \"Mattermost unreachable error\"가 표시된 빨간색 경고 "
"막대가 없는지 확인합니다(이 막대는 웹소켓 구성 오류를 나타냅니다)."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:57
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "문서화"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Include link to official Mattermost documentation**. README or "
"equivalent contains statement **Please see https://docs.mattermost.com "
"for official documentation.**"
msgstr ""
"**공식 Mattermost 문서 링크를 포함합니다**. README 등에 **Please see "
"https://docs.mattermost.com for official documentation.** 문구를 "
"포함합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:61
msgid ""
"Include the following information in text, markdown, HTML or other "
"format. Square brackets ``[]`` indicate optional statements depending on "
"the configuration of your solution:"
msgstr ""
"다음 정보를 텍스트, 마크다운, HTML 또는 기타 형식으로 포함하세요. 대괄호 "
"``[]``\\ 는 솔루션 구성에 따라 선택적인 문구를 나타냅니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:63
msgid ""
"This deployment solution installs [and upgrades] a Mattermost server to "
"provide secure, private cloud messaging for teams and enterprises. More "
"information is available at: https://mattermost.com"
msgstr ""
"This deployment solution installs [and upgrades] a Mattermost server to "
"provide secure, private cloud messaging for teams and enterprises. More "
"information is available at: https://mattermost.com"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:65
msgid ""
"Following automated deployment, the following steps are required to make "
"your system production-ready:"
msgstr ""
"자동 배포 후, 시스템을 프로덕션 준비 상태로 만들려면 다음 단계가 "
"필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:67
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure SSL for Mattermost <deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-"
"proxy:configure nginx with ssl and http/2>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mattermost용 SSL 구성 <deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-"
"proxy:configure nginx with ssl and http/2>`"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:68
msgid ""
":doc:`Configure SMTP email for Mattermost </administration-"
"guide/configure/smtp-email>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mattermost용 SMTP 이메일 구성 </administration-guide/configure/smtp-"
"email>`"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Unofficial deployment options should be documented**. Unofficial "
"deployment configurations, such as use of Linux operating systems that "
"are not officially supported, should be documented in the README."
msgstr ""
"**비공식 배포 옵션은 문서화해야 합니다**. 공식 지원되지 않는 Linux 운영 체제 "
"사용 등 비공식 배포 구성은 README에 문서화해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:73
msgid "Security updates"
msgstr "보안 업데이트"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:75
msgid ""
"**Document commitment to providing security updates.** README or "
"equivalent states ``We highly recommend users subscribe to the Mattermost"
" security updates email list. When notified of a security update, the "
"maintainers of this deployment solution will make an effort to update to "
"the secure version within 10 days.``"
msgstr ""
"**보안 업데이트 제공에 대한 의지를 문서화합니다.** README 등에 ``We highly "
"recommend users subscribe to the Mattermost security updates email list. "
"When notified of a security update, the maintainers of this deployment "
"solution will make an effort to update to the secure version within 10 "
"days.`` 라고 명시합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Commit to making an effort for your deployment to provide the latest "
"security update within 10 days of announcement**. This is typically a "
"one-line change."
msgstr ""
"**발표 후 10일 이내에 최신 보안 업데이트를 제공하도록 노력할 것을 "
"약속합니다**. 이는 보통 한 줄 변경입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:80
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "브랜딩"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Support Mattermost branding and naming guidelines**. To ensure naming "
"is clear across deployment solutions, README or equivalent should contain"
" ``The name for this deployment solution in the context of `Mattermost "
"branding guidelines "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/operations/operations/publishing"
"/publishing-guidelines/brand-and-visual-design-guidelines>`_ is `[NAME] "
"for Mattermost by [CREATOR]`.`` For example, ``Multi-node Docker "
"deployment solution for Mattermost by John Doe``. This is the name that "
"will be used to refer to your work in Mattermost community materials."
msgstr ""
"**Mattermost 브랜딩 및 명명 가이드라인을 준수합니다**. 배포 솔루션 전반에서 "
"명명이 명확하도록, README 등에 ``The name for this deployment solution in "
"the context of `Mattermost branding guidelines "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/operations/operations/publishing"
"/publishing-guidelines/brand-and-visual-design-guidelines>`_ is `[NAME] "
"for Mattermost by [CREATOR]`.`` 를 포함해야 합니다. 예를 들어 ``Multi-node "
"Docker deployment solution for Mattermost by John Doe``\\ 입니다. 이는 "
"Mattermost 커뮤니티 자료에서 해당 작업을 지칭하는 데 사용되는 이름입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:85
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/orchestration.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Support upgrade of Mattermost**. Enable user interface or command line "
"upgrade of a Mattermost deployment to latest version based on `upgrade "
"procedure when Mattermost is embedded "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/faq/#how-should-i-automate-"
"the-install-and-upgrade-of-mattermost-when-included-in-another-"
"application>`_."
msgstr ""
"**Mattermost 업그레이드를 지원합니다**. `Mattermost가 내장된 경우의 업그레이드 "
"절차 <https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/faq/#how-should-i-"
"automate-the-install-and-upgrade-of-mattermost-when-included-in-another-"
"application>`_\\ 에 따라 Mattermost 배포를 최신 버전으로 업그레이드하는 "
"사용자 인터페이스 또는 명령줄 업그레이드를 지원합니다."

